  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueControl: {fileID: 1518110120}
  Sentences:
  - Seth. There has been a malfuntion.
  - We have crashed  on the planet Earth.
  - Unfortunately, the spaceship parts have dispersed across the island.
  - I can fix the spaceship with all the missing parts. Find all the parts and bring
    them to the spaceship.
  - Once all parts are coolected i will fix the spaceship and get us back home.
  - There are six parts in total.
  - Becareful on your way because there are creatures that might kill you.
  - Hurry up and collect the parts before your parents start looking for you!!
  - GOOD LUCK!!!
  wordSpeed: 0.1
  sentenceDelay: 1
